Package: smoother
Type: Package
Title: Functions Relating to the Smoothing of Numerical Data
Version: 1.3.9001
Author: Nicholas Hamilton [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Nicholas Hamilton <n.hamilton@unsw.edu.au>
Authors@R: person(given = "Nicholas", family = "Hamilton", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "n.hamilton@unsw.edu.au")
Description: A collection of methods for smoothing numerical data, commencing
    with a port of the Matlab gaussian window smoothing function. In addition,
    several functions typically used in smoothing of financial data are included.
    Compatibility updates by Renova.
